reflex.Model has been deprecated in version 0.9.2. Directly use database ORM layer, like sqlalchemy or SQLModel. It will be completely removed in 1.0.0. (<frozen abc>:106)
Event handler on_submit expects (dict[str, typing.Any]) -> () but got (dict[str, str]) -> () as annotated in Chat_n1.submit_message instead. This may lead to unexpected behavior but is intentionally ignored for on_submit.
